OL,3,GNEWSAWilliamson Tunnels centre to close
OL,4,Adespite campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FA heritage centre dedicated to
OL,7,Fpreserving Liverpool's mysterious
OL,8,Funderground tunnels is set to close.
OL,10,FThe Williamson Tunnel Heritage Centre
OL,11,Fin Edge Hill blamed rising rent and
OL,12,Fmaintenance costs and a failure to
OL,13,Fsecure long-term investment.
OL,15,FThe centre's manager, Dave Bridson, has
OL,16,Fspent 30 years excavating the site and
OL,17,Frunning tours of the tunnel network and
OL,18,Fsaid he was "very, very sad" to have to
OL,19,Fclose.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
